{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/0ea785501d80890396b4d394b6416e22.avif?t=1757422240\" width=204 height=69 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Arrow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through challenging levels armed with a single magic arrow. Fire your arrow, freeze it in midair to turn it into a temporary platform, and then recall it back to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/a83cf45a9e71c512046375fca0e32618.poster.avif?t=1757422240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/a83cf45a9e71c512046375fca0e32618.webm?t=1757422240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/a83cf45a9e71c512046375fca0e32618.mp4?t=1757422240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your enemies head on or expertly maneuver around them. Utilize creative angles and strategies to overcome the obstacles in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/9ddbd2e090d9cb44a94123c1527f30db.poster.avif?t=1757422240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/9ddbd2e090d9cb44a94123c1527f30db.webm?t=1757422240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/9ddbd2e090d9cb44a94123c1527f30db.mp4?t=1757422240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against The Clock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded for traversing levels quickly! Collect Bronze/Silver/Gold/Developer Archer Medals for completing levels fast enough, unlocking bonus levels, cosmetics, and more! Just don't be foolish enough to actually try to collect Developer Archer Medals - which are only obtained by beating my personal best time... and good luck with that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/140daed285f4c35d6088e30fe091d2dd.poster.avif?t=1757422240\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/140daed285f4c35d6088e30fe091d2dd.webm?t=1757422240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/140daed285f4c35d6088e30fe091d2dd.mp4?t=1757422240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992340?t=1757422240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992340?t=1757422240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/09cf1ccbbd7026a60529c59e881ce6798af7de3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757422240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/09cf1ccbbd7026a60529c59e881ce6798af7de3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757422240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_supp